    <div class="dash-col">
      <p class="deprecated-text"">Deprecated: </p>
      <p>  <p>Creates a channel to listen for XML-RPC calls. Will trigger a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Remote_data" target="_blank">remote_data</a> event with channel id once it is available.</p>
</p>
    </div>

